sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Worker A
    participant R as Redis
    participant B as Worker B
    participant C as Worker C
    A->>R: SET lock NX PX 2000 (value A)
    Note over A: FROZEN past the TTL
    R-->>R: key expires
    B->>R: SET lock NX PX 2000 (value B)
    R-->>B: OK — B is the owner
    Note over A: A resumes, finishes, releases
    A->>R: DEL lock
    Note over R: A just deleted B's lock
    C->>R: SET lock NX PX 2000 (value C)
    R-->>C: OK
    Note over B,C: B and C now both hold "the" lock,<br/>and B was never touched by the bug
